            "Cupó anual",
            "Cupó + repartiment de beneficis d'equity",
            "Repartiment de beneficis d'equity",
          ],
        },
        {
          label: "Quan cobra",
          cells: [
            "Durant tot el projecte",
            "Durant el projecte + a la sortida",
            "A la sortida del projecte",
          ],
        },
        {
          label: "Perfil de renda",
          cells: [
            "Previsible, contractual",
            "Cupó + benefici a la sortida",
            "Pagament únic a la sortida",
          ],
        },
        {
          label: "Posició en l'estructura de capital",
          cells: [
            "Preferent (garantida)",
            "Preferent + subordinada",
            "Subordinada (propietat)",
          ],
        },
        {
          label: "Perfil de risc",
          cells: ["Més baix", "Equilibrat", "Més alt"],
        },
        {
          label: "Potencial de plusvàlua",
          cells: ["Limitat al cupó", "Cupó limitat + equity sense límit", "Sense límit"],
        },
        {
          label: "Termini de tinença típic",
          cells: ["Més curt", "Mitjà a llarg", "Més llarg"],
        },
        {
          label: "Més indicat per a",
          cells: [
            "Preservació del capital",
            "La majoria d'inversors (perfil equilibrat)",
            "Maximització de la rendibilitat",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
    explainers: {
      eyebrow: "Entendre les estructures",
      title: "Com funciona realment cada estructura",
      intro:
        "Una mirada més detallada a en què inverteix, com es generen les rendibilitats i on se situa cada estructura en l'espectre de risc.",
      items: [
        {
          tag: "Estructura 01",
          title: "Deute",
          returnLine: "Cupó anual · es fixa per projecte",
          paragraphs: [
            `En una posició de deute vostè està <strong>prestant capital</strong> al projecte, no adquirint-ne una part. A canvi rep un cupó anual contractual, calibrat operació per operació i pagat en intervals acordats al llarg de la vida de la inversió. El cupó exacte depèn del projecte concret: consulteu les nostres ${oppLink("Oportunitats actuals")} per conèixer les xifres vigents.`,
            "El seu capital ocupa una <strong>posició preferent en l'estructura de capital</strong>, la qual cosa significa que, en cas de sortida, refinançament o liquidació, els titulars de deute cobren <em>abans</em> que els titulars d'equity. El préstec està garantit per l'immoble andorrà subjacent, aportant un col·lateral d'actiu real darrere de la seva rendibilitat.",
            "La contrapartida és senzilla: renuncia a l'exposició a la plusvàlua del projecte a canvi de previsibilitat i protecció davant de pèrdues. Encara que el projecte generi rendibilitats excepcionals, la seva rendibilitat queda limitada al cupó acordat. De la mateixa manera, queda aïllat d'una part substancial del risc d'execució del projecte.",
            "El deute sol convenir a inversors que busquen un <strong>flux de caixa contractual i estable</strong>, volen un horitzó de sortida definit i valoren la preservació del capital per sobre d'una rendibilitat extraordinària.",
          ],
        },
        {
          tag: "Estructura 02 · Més popular",
          title: "Deute + Equity",
          returnLine: "Cupó + Plusvàlua d'equity · es fixa per projecte",
          paragraphs: [
            "Una posició combinada, i l'estructura que <strong>tria la majoria dels nostres inversors</strong>. El seu compromís es reparteix entre un tram de deute i un tram d'equity, de manera que ocupa <em>totes dues</em> capes de l'estructura de capital alhora.",
            `La part de deute paga un cupó anual, normalment una mica inferior al cupó de deute pur, perquè també participa en la plusvàlua d'equity. La part d'equity s'abona com una participació en el benefici del projecte quan l'actiu es ven o es refinança. El repartiment entre deute i equity, i les xifres exactes de totes dues parts, es fixen per projecte: consulteu les nostres ${oppLink("Oportunitats actuals")} per conèixer les xifres vigents.`,
            "El resultat és un perfil que <strong>equilibra la protecció davant de pèrdues amb la participació plena en la plusvàlua</strong>: rep una renda contractual mentre el projecte es desenvolupa i comparteix el guany a la sortida. Si el projecte rendeix per sota del previst en la part d'equity, el cupó garantit continua esmorteint la rendibilitat global.",
            "La majoria dels inversors es decanten per aquesta opció perquè captura l'atractiu de totes dues estructures sense comprometre's plenament amb cap. És el desplegament més habitual entre la nostra base d'inversors.",
          ],
        },
        {
          tag: "Estructura 03",
          title: "Equity",
          returnLine: "Repartiment de beneficis d'equity a la sortida · es fixa per projecte",
          paragraphs: [
            "En una posició d'equity vostè pren una <strong>participació directa en la propietat</strong> de l'entitat de projecte que posseeix l'actiu andorrà subjacent. És un soci al costat d'Equity Partners, no un prestador nostre.",
            `No hi ha cupó. Les rendibilitats es materialitzen quan el projecte es ven o es refinança, moment en què rep la seva part proporcional del benefici. Les rendibilitats objectiu es fixen per projecte i reflecteixen el perfil específic de risc i immobilització de cada operació. Per conèixer l'objectiu concret d'una oportunitat determinada, consulteu les nostres ${oppLink("Oportunitats actuals")}.`,
            "L'equity està <strong>subordinat al deute</strong> en l'estructura de capital, la qual cosa significa que els prestadors cobren primer. A canvi, l'equity captura <em>tota</em> la plusvàlua per sobre de les obligacions de deute, sense límit. Un projecte que supera les expectatives genera rendibilitats sensiblement superiors per a l'equity que per al deute.",
            "L'equity està pensat per a inversors que poden tolerar terminis de tinença més llargs, l'absència de flux de caixa intermedi i un risc de projecte significatiu, a canvi del <strong>major potencial de rendibilitat</strong> de les tres estructures.",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
    cta: {
      title: "No sap quina estructura li encaixa?",
      body:
        "Reservi una videotrucada de 30 minuts amb el nostre equip d'inversió. Li presentarem les oportunitats actives, li explicarem com s'aplicaria cada estructura al seu mandat i respondrem qualsevol pregunta sobre rendibilitats, risc i calendari.",
      button: "Sol·licitar videotrucada",
    },
  },
};

const t = copy[locale];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang={locale}>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <SEO
      title={t.seo.title}
      description={t.seo.description}
      locale={locale}
      path={Astro.url.pathname}
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/EP favicon.png" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

      :root {
        --navy: #0f1a2a;
        --navy-deep: #0a1422;
        --navy-mid: #172235;
        --green: #53b27f;
        --green-light: #6ec595;
        --green-dark: #3f9568;
        --line: #dce3ee;
        --line-soft: #eef2f8;
        --text: #172235;
        --muted: #5a667a;
        --font: "Montserrat", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: var(--font);
        background: #ffffff;
        color: var(--text);
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .container {
        width: min(1120px, 92vw);
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      [data-animate] {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(18px);
        transition: opacity 700ms ease, transform 700ms ease;
      }

      [data-animate].is-visible {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      /* ────────────────  Hero  ──────────────── */
      .invest-hero {
        position: relative;
        padding: 9rem 0 5rem;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 18% 0%, rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.14), transparent 55%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 100%, rgba(130, 147, 174, 0.16), transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(160deg, #0a1422 0%, #101e34 50%, #0a1422 100%);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .invest-hero::before,
      .invest-hero::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        width: 620px;
        height: 620px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        filter: blur(80px);
        pointer-events: none;
        opacity: 0.55;
      }

      .invest-hero::before {
        top: -180px;
        right: -160px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.18), transparent 70%);
      }

      .invest-hero::after {
        bottom: -220px;
        left: -160px;
        background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(130, 147, 174, 0.18), transparent 70%);
      }

      .invest-hero .container {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      .invest-hero-inner {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .invest-hero .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.7rem;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.28em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--green-light);
        margin: 0;
      }

      .invest-hero .eyebrow::before {
        content: "";
        width: 32px;
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--green));
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .invest-hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.4vw, 3.2rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f3f7fc;
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.012em;
      }

      .invest-hero h1::after {
        content: "";
        display: block;
        width: 64px;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), rgba(83, 178, 127, 0));
        margin-top: 1.1rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
      }

      .invest-hero p {
        font-size: 1.02rem;
        color: rgba(220, 230, 245, 0.72);
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .invest-hero-link {
        color: #7bd6a2;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 214, 162, 0.45);
        padding-bottom: 1px;
        transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
      }

      .invest-hero-link:hover {
        color: #ffffff;
        border-bottom-color: #ffffff;
      }

      /* ────────────────  Section base  ──────────────── */
      .invest-section {
        position: relative;
        padding: 5rem 0;
      }

      .invest-section.is-light {
        background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% -10%, #eef2f8 0, #f4f6fa 50%);
      }

      .invest-section.is-white {
        background: #ffffff;
      }

      .invest-section.is-spotlight {
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 18% 0%, rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.10), transparent 55%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 100%, rgba(130, 147, 174, 0.12), transparent 60%),
          linear-gradient(160deg, #0a1422 0%, #101e34 50%, #0a1422 100%);
        color: #f3f7fc;
      }

      .invest-section-heading {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.35rem;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .invest-section-heading .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.7rem;
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.28em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        margin: 0;
      }

      .invest-section.is-spotlight .invest-section-heading .eyebrow {
        color: var(--green-light);
      }

      .invest-section-heading .eyebrow::before {
        content: "";
        width: 32px;
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--green));
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .invest-section-heading h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--navy);
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        line-height: 1.15;
        letter-spacing: -0.012em;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }

      .invest-section.is-spotlight .invest-section-heading h2 {
        color: #f3f7fc;
      }

      .invest-section-heading h2::after {
        content: "";
        display: block;
        width: 64px;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), rgba(83, 178, 127, 0));
        margin-top: 1rem;
        border-radius: 2px;
      }

      .invest-section-heading p {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.02rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 1.2rem 0 0;
      }

      .invest-section.is-spotlight .invest-section-heading p {
        color: rgba(220, 230, 245, 0.72);
      }

      /* ────────────────  Three structure cards  ──────────────── */
      .invest-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 1.4rem;
        align-items: stretch;
      }

      @media (max-width: 960px) {
        .invest-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 1.6rem;
        }
      }

      .invest-card {
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 1.2rem;
        padding: 2rem 1.8rem 2.1rem;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.07);
        transition: transform 320ms ease, box-shadow 320ms ease,
          border-color 320ms ease;
      }

      .invest-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        box-shadow: 0 22px 44px rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.12);
        border-color: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.45);
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured {
        background:
          linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.06), transparent 60%),
          #ffffff;
        border: 1.5px solid var(--green);
        box-shadow: 0 24px 50px rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.18);
        transform: translateY(-8px);
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured:hover {
        transform: translateY(-12px);
        box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.24);
      }

      @media (max-width: 960px) {
        .invest-card.is-featured {
          transform: none;
        }
        .invest-card.is-featured:hover {
          transform: translateY(-4px);
        }
      }

      .invest-card-badge {
        position: absolute;
        top: -0.7rem;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        background: var(--green);
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 0.62rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        line-height: 1;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.35);
      }

      /* Role pill — product family (Andorra Real Estate Fund / Direct Project Financing) */
      .invest-card-role {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.06);
        font-size: 0.66rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
        width: fit-content;
        margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured .invest-card-role {
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.14);
        color: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .invest-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.55rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--navy);
        margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      /* Subtitle — Passive Investment · Lowest Risk, etc. */
      .invest-card-subtitle {
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
      }

      /* Fading divider — matches advantage-home-card-divider on the homepage */
      .invest-card-divider {
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.5),
          rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.05)
        );
        margin: 0.65rem 0 1.25rem;
      }

      .invest-card-tagline {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
      }

      /* Iconified returns card — matches homepage What We Offer styling */
      .invest-card-returns {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1.05rem 1.15rem;
        border-radius: 0.85rem;
        background: var(--line-soft);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured .invest-card-returns {
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.08);
        border-color: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.3);
      }

      .invest-card-returns-icon {
        width: 3.4rem;
        height: 3.4rem;
        border-radius: 0.7rem;
        background: rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.05);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured .invest-card-returns-icon {
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.16);
        border-color: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.3);
        color: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .invest-card-returns-icon svg {
        width: 1.5rem;
        height: 1.5rem;
        fill: none;
        stroke: currentColor;
        stroke-width: 2;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }

      .invest-card-returns-label {
        font-size: 0.66rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
      }

      .invest-card-returns-value {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--navy);
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured .invest-card-returns-value {
        color: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .invest-card-returns-sub {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }

      .invest-card-features {
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
        margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.7rem;
        flex: 1;
      }

      .invest-card-features li {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .invest-card-check {
        flex: none;
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        margin-top: 2px;
        color: var(--green);
      }

      .invest-card-check svg {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        fill: none;
        stroke: currentColor;
        stroke-width: 2;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }

      .invest-card-cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        width: 100%;
        background: var(--navy);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.95rem 1.4rem;
        border-radius: 0.55rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--navy);
        transition: background 220ms ease, transform 220ms ease,
          border-color 220ms ease, box-shadow 220ms ease;
      }

      .invest-card-cta:hover {
        background: var(--green);
        border-color: var(--green);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.28);
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured .invest-card-cta {
        background: var(--green);
        border-color: var(--green);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.28);
      }

      .invest-card.is-featured .invest-card-cta:hover {
        background: var(--navy);
        border-color: var(--navy);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 28px rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.28);
      }

      /* ────────────────  Comparison table  ──────────────── */
      .invest-compare-wrap {
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 1.2rem;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.06);
      }

      .invest-compare-note {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0.95rem 1.3rem;
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.06);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .invest-compare-link {
        color: var(--green-dark);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(63, 149, 104, 0.4);
        padding-bottom: 1px;
        transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
      }

      .invest-compare-link:hover {
        color: var(--navy);
        border-bottom-color: var(--navy);
      }

      .invest-compare {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-size: 0.93rem;
      }

      .invest-compare thead th {
        background: var(--line-soft);
        color: var(--navy);
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: left;
        padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .invest-compare thead th.is-highlight {
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.12);
        color: var(--green-dark);
      }

      /* Column header role pill (synced with structure cards) */
      .invest-compare-th-role {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.08);
        font-size: 0.56rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .invest-compare thead th.is-highlight .invest-compare-th-role {
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.2);
        color: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .invest-compare-th-title {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.16em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .invest-compare tbody td {
        padding: 1rem 1.3rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--text);
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      .invest-compare tbody td.is-highlight {
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.04);
      }

      .invest-compare tbody tr:last-child td {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .invest-compare-row-label {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--navy);
        background: #fafbfd !important;
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .invest-compare-wrap {
          overflow-x: auto;
        }
        .invest-compare {
          min-width: 640px;
        }
      }

      /* ────────────────  Deep-dive explainer blocks  ──────────────── */
      .invest-explainer {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.9rem;
      }

      .invest-explainer-block {
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.04);
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: box-shadow 240ms ease, border-color 240ms ease;
      }

      .invest-explainer-block:hover {
        border-color: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.35);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.07);
      }

      .invest-explainer-block[open] {
        border-color: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.45);
        box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(15, 26, 42, 0.09);
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary {
        list-style: none;
        cursor: pointer;
        padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.2rem;
        outline: none;
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary::marker {
        content: "";
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary:focus-visible {
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.4);
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary-text {
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.45rem;
        min-width: 0;
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .invest-explainer-tag {
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.22em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary h3 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--navy);
        margin: 0;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      .invest-explainer-return {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .invest-explainer-chevron {
        width: 34px;
        height: 34px;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.1);
        color: var(--green-dark);
        flex-shrink: 0;
        transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.65, 0.35, 1), background 200ms ease;
      }

      .invest-explainer-chevron svg {
        width: 14px;
        height: 14px;
        stroke: currentColor;
        fill: none;
        stroke-width: 2.5;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }

      .invest-explainer-summary:hover .invest-explainer-chevron {
        background: rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.2);
      }

      .invest-explainer-block[open] .invest-explainer-chevron {
        transform: rotate(180deg);
      }

      .invest-explainer-body {
        padding: 0 1.6rem 1.6rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding-top: 1.4rem;
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      .invest-explainer-body p {
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .invest-explainer-body p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .invest-explainer-body strong {
        color: var(--navy);
      }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .invest-explainer-summary {
          padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;
          gap: 1rem;
        }

        .invest-explainer-summary h3 {
          font-size: 1.15rem;
        }

        .invest-explainer-summary-row {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: 0.3rem;
        }

        .invest-explainer-return {
          white-space: normal;
        }

        .invest-explainer-body {
          padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem 1.3rem;
        }
      }

      .invest-explainer-link {
        color: var(--green-dark);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(63, 149, 104, 0.4);
        padding-bottom: 1px;
        transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
      }

      .invest-explainer-link:hover {
        color: var(--navy);
        border-bottom-color: var(--navy);
      }

      /* ────────────────  Bottom CTA  ──────────────── */
      .invest-cta-banner {
        padding: 4rem 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse at 18% 0%, rgba(83, 178, 127, 0.14), transparent 55%),
          linear-gradient(160deg, #0a1422 0%, #101e34 50%, #0a1422 100%);
      }

      .invest-cta-inner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border-radius: 1.2rem;
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .invest-cta-inner {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          padding: 1.8rem;
        }
      }

      .invest-cta-copy h2 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #f3f7fc;
        letter-spacing: -0.012em;
      }

      .invest-cta-copy p {
        margin: 0;
        color: rgba(220, 230, 245, 0.78);
        line-height: 1.6;
        max-width: 36rem;
      }

      .invest-cta-btn {
        flex: none;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        background: var(--green);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 1.05rem 1.6rem;
        border-radius: 0.55rem;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        border: 1px solid var(--green);
        transition: background 220ms ease, transform 220ms ease,
          border-color 220ms ease, box-shadow 220ms ease;
      }

      .invest-cta-btn svg {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        fill: none;
        stroke: currentColor;
        stroke-width: 2;
        stroke-linecap: round;
        stroke-linejoin: round;
      }

      .invest-cta-btn:hover {
        background: #ffffff;
        color: var(--navy);
        border-color: #ffffff;
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <InnerSiteHeader
      active="invest"
      menuToggleId="mobile-menu-toggle"
      offsetFirstSection={false}
      locale={locale}
      currentPath={Astro.url.pathname}
    />

    <!-- ───────────  Hero  ─────────── -->
    <section class="invest-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="invest-hero-inner" data-animate>
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.hero.eyebrow}</p>
          <h1>{t.hero.title}</h1>
          <p>
            {t.hero.introBefore}<a href={opportunitiesHref} class="invest-hero-link">{t.hero.introLink}</a>{t.hero.introAfter}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ───────────  Three structure cards  ─────────── -->
    <section class="invest-section is-light" id="structures">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="invest-section-heading" data-animate>
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.structures.eyebrow}</p>
          <h2>{t.structures.title}</h2>
          <p>{t.structures.intro}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="invest-grid" data-animate>
          <!-- DEBT -->
          <article class="invest-card">
            <span class="invest-card-role">{t.structures.debt.role}</span>
            <h3>{t.structures.debt.title}</h3>
            <p class="invest-card-subtitle">{t.structures.debt.subtitle}</p>
            <div class="invest-card-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <p class="invest-card-tagline">{t.structures.debt.tagline}</p>
            <div class="invest-card-returns">
              <span class="invest-card-returns-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-label">{t.structures.returnLabel}</p>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-value">{t.structures.debt.returnValue}</p>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-sub">{t.structures.returnSub}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="invest-card-features">
              {t.structures.debt.features.map((feature) => (
                <li>
                  <span class="invest-card-check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m8.7 12.2 2.1 2.2 4.5-5"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <span>{feature}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <a class="invest-card-cta" href={`${contactHref}#video-call`}>{t.structures.cta}</a>
          </article>

          <!-- DEBT + EQUITY (featured) -->
          <article class="invest-card is-featured">
            <span class="invest-card-badge">{t.structures.debtEquity.badge}</span>
            <span class="invest-card-role">{t.structures.debtEquity.role}</span>
            <h3>{t.structures.debtEquity.title}</h3>
            <p class="invest-card-subtitle">{t.structures.debtEquity.subtitle}</p>
            <div class="invest-card-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <p class="invest-card-tagline">{t.structures.debtEquity.tagline}</p>
            <div class="invest-card-returns">
              <span class="invest-card-returns-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 17 9 11l4 4 8-8"/><path d="M14 7h7v7"/></svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-label">{t.structures.returnLabel}</p>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-value">{t.structures.debtEquity.returnValue}</p>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-sub">{t.structures.returnSub}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="invest-card-features">
              {t.structures.debtEquity.features.map((feature) => (
                <li>
                  <span class="invest-card-check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m8.7 12.2 2.1 2.2 4.5-5"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <span>{feature}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <a class="invest-card-cta" href={`${contactHref}#video-call`}>{t.structures.cta}</a>
          </article>

          <!-- EQUITY -->
          <article class="invest-card">
            <span class="invest-card-role">{t.structures.equity.role}</span>
            <h3>{t.structures.equity.title}</h3>
            <p class="invest-card-subtitle">{t.structures.equity.subtitle}</p>
            <div class="invest-card-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <p class="invest-card-tagline">{t.structures.equity.tagline}</p>
            <div class="invest-card-returns">
              <span class="invest-card-returns-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="16"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="11"/><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <div>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-label">{t.structures.returnLabel}</p>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-value">{t.structures.equity.returnValue}</p>
                <p class="invest-card-returns-sub">{t.structures.returnSub}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="invest-card-features">
              {t.structures.equity.features.map((feature) => (
                <li>
                  <span class="invest-card-check" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m8.7 12.2 2.1 2.2 4.5-5"/></svg>
                  </span>
                  <span>{feature}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <a class="invest-card-cta" href={`${contactHref}#video-call`}>{t.structures.cta}</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ───────────  Comparison table  ─────────── -->
    <section class="invest-section is-white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="invest-section-heading" data-animate>
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.compare.eyebrow}</p>
          <h2>{t.compare.title}</h2>
          <p>{t.compare.intro}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="invest-compare-wrap" data-animate>
          <p class="invest-compare-note">{t.compare.noteBefore}<a href={opportunitiesHref} class="invest-compare-link">{t.compare.noteLink}</a>{t.compare.noteAfter}</p>
          <table class="invest-compare">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th></th>
                <th>
                  <span class="invest-compare-th-role">{t.compare.cols[0].role}</span>
                  <span class="invest-compare-th-title">{t.compare.cols[0].title}</span>
                </th>
                <th class="is-highlight">
                  <span class="invest-compare-th-role">{t.compare.cols[1].role}</span>
                  <span class="invest-compare-th-title">{t.compare.cols[1].title}</span>
                </th>
                <th>
                  <span class="invest-compare-th-role">{t.compare.cols[2].role}</span>
                  <span class="invest-compare-th-title">{t.compare.cols[2].title}</span>
                </th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {t.compare.rows.map((row) => (
                <tr>
                  <td class="invest-compare-row-label">{row.label}</td>
                  <td>{row.cells[0]}</td>
                  <td class="is-highlight">{row.cells[1]}</td>
                  <td>{row.cells[2]}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ───────────  Deep-dive explainer  ─────────── -->
    <section class="invest-section is-light">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="invest-section-heading" data-animate>
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.explainers.eyebrow}</p>
          <h2>{t.explainers.title}</h2>
          <p>{t.explainers.intro}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="invest-explainer">
          {t.explainers.items.map((item) => (
            <details class="invest-explainer-block" data-animate>
              <summary class="invest-explainer-summary">
                <div class="invest-explainer-summary-text">
                  <span class="invest-explainer-tag">{item.tag}</span>
                  <div class="invest-explainer-summary-row">
                    <h3>{item.title}</h3>
                    <span class="invest-explainer-return">{item.returnLine}</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="invest-explainer-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
                </span>
              </summary>
              <div class="invest-explainer-body">
                {item.paragraphs.map((paragraph) => (
                  <p set:html={paragraph} />
                ))}
              </div>
            </details>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ───────────  Bottom CTA  ─────────── -->
    <section class="invest-cta-banner">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="invest-cta-inner" data-animate>
          <div class="invest-cta-copy">
            <h2>{t.cta.title}</h2>
            <p>{t.cta.body}</p>
          </div>
          <a class="invest-cta-btn" href={`${contactHref}#video-call`}>
            {t.cta.button}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <NewsletterSignup emailInputId="newsletter-email-invest" locale={locale} />
    <SiteFooter locale={locale} />

    <script type="module">
      const targets = document.querySelectorAll("[data-animate]");
      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
        (entries) => {
          entries.forEach((entry) => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.classList.add("is-visible");
              observer.unobserve(entry.target);
            }
          });
        },
        { threshold: 0.08 }
      );
      targets.forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
